= Regulation

== The 2020 Amendments

#slide[
  === The SEC treated proxy advice as a solicitation, and then backed away.
  #inv("A5")

  - The 2020 amendments conditioned the exemptions on notice to the issuer.

  #callout["The term solicitation includes ... the furnishing of a form of proxy or other communication to security holders under circumstances reasonably calculated to result in the procurement, withholding or revocation of a proxy." Rule 14a-1(l)(1)(iii).]

  - The 2022 rescission removed the notice conditions but kept the definition.
]
